# Only the new tests are versioned. The legacy files in this directory
# (tests/test_*.nim, tests/tests/, tests/steps/, ...) were hidden by the old
# version of this file, so they are not in the snapshot f06a84e1; they stay on
# disk, untouched, until someone decides what to do with them.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/unit/
!/acceptance/
!/test_all.nim
/unit/*
!/unit/*.nim
/test_all
